# Files that must not be packed into the app archive.
# The unit tests are run with `node --test` on a developer machine; nothing on the Homey
# ever loads them, so shipping them only costs archive size and on-device storage
# (test/ems.test.js alone is ~143 KB of the ~228 KB total).
test/

# The sources the register lists were built from, and the notes that record why things are
# the way they are. Both belong in the repository; neither belongs on somebody else's Homey.
# Together ~193 KB — roughly what test/ was worth, and excluded for the same reason rather
# than for the size: nothing on the device ever opens them. Measured against the build, not
# assumed.
#
# Only the Markdown README goes. README.txt, README.de.txt and README.nl.txt are the App
# Store description in three languages and have to stay — so this is an exact file name on
# purpose, never README*.
Modbus Register.xlsx
README.md
docs/
